+| Website correction versus QFR correction | The earlier study preserves the 2004 web-entry revision and disputed marking/date details. The 2006 report still separately recommends correcting the May2003 QFR. A changed website is not a verified QFR transmittal. | Actual corrected QFR and recipient acknowledgment. Prior FC05/FC09 and R04 remain open. |
